%
% Integrated features from all three team files:
% 1. Data collection + function generation
% 2. Interactive digital-twin dashboard
% 3. Dynamic early-warning forecast
%
% The 30-day data pipeline and the 8-hour dashboard simulation are
% intentionally kept as separate layers so that one feature cannot
% overwrite or break another feature's variables.
%
% Main dashboard features preserved:
% - Terrain generation and slope calculation
% - Factor of Safety
% - Rainfall intensity input
% - Time slider
% - Live risk map
% - Houses and roads
% - Affected infrastructure
% - Stability graph
