% - Recommended action
%
% Data-team features preserved:
% - 30-day synthetic rainfall
% - Synthetic terrain data
% - Soil-moisture generation
% - Historical landslide catalog loading
% - Data-level Factor of Safety
% - Rainfall risk factor
% - Combined risk score / risk level
% - CSV handoff output
%
% Forecast feature preserved and integrated:
% - 4-hour rainfall forecast
% - Forecast soil saturation
% - Forecast pore pressure
% - Forecast minimum FoS
% - Current-vs-future warning distinction
% ============================================================

